            <p>Yapper does not use advertising cookies or trackers. We do not engage in cross-site tracking or serve targeted advertisements.</p>
            <p>See our full <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for more detail.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="s18">
            <h2>18. Do Not Track Signals</h2>
            <p>
              Yapper honours "Do Not Track" (DNT) browser signals. When we detect a DNT signal, we
              disable all non-essential analytics tracking for that session. Additionally, Yapper
              supports the Global Privacy Control (GPC) signal as a valid opt-out of sale/sharing
              under the CCPA.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="s19">
